flowchart TD
    ask["1 · YOUR REQUEST<br/>Here is my book catalogue.<br/>Find books on watermills."]
    inspect["2 · AGENT LOOKS<br/>The file has titles<br/>and descriptive notes."]
    choose["3 · AGENT SETS IT UP<br/>Show title, author, year.<br/>Search the notes too."]
    test["4 · TEST THE SEARCH<br/>Find a book where only<br/>the notes say watermill."]
    save["5 · SAVE THE REASON<br/>Git: search notes too.<br/>Why: titles missed books."]
    use["6 · YOU USE THE APP<br/>Read the matching books.<br/>Export your selection."]
    ask --> inspect
    inspect --> choose
    choose --> test
    test -->|Works| save
    test -.->|Not yet: improve it| choose
    save --> use
    lessons["LATER: COLLECT EXAMPLES<br/>Which fields helped?<br/>Which searches failed?"]
    improve["FUTURE: USE DSPy<br/>Try better field choices.<br/>Test on unseen requests."]
    save -.-> lessons
    lessons -.-> improve
    class ask input
    class inspect,choose agent
    class test,save core
    class use output
    class lessons,improve optional
